<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verify Your RLIFE Account</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f3f4f6;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        
        .email-header {
            background: #667eea;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            padding: 50px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .email-header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
            animation: pulse 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.5; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.1); opacity: 0.8; }
        }
        
        .logo-container {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .logo {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #667eea;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }
        
        .email-header h1 {
            color: #ffffff !important;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        
        .email-header p {
            color: #ffffff !important;
            font-size: 16px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        
        .email-body {
            padding: 50px 40px;
        }
        
        .greeting {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #111827;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .message {
            color: #374151;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        
        .message strong {
            color: #111827;
        }
        
        .cta-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #667eea !important;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none !important;
            padding: 18px 50px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 2px solid #667eea;
        }
        
        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.5);
            background: #5568d3 !important;
        }
        
        .features {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6f8ff 0%, #f0f3ff 100%);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        
        .feature-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .feature-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        
        .feature-icon {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-right: 15px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            font-size: 20px;
        }
        
        .feature-text {
            flex: 1;
        }
        
        .feature-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #111827;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        
        .feature-description {
            color: #4b5563;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #e2e8f0, transparent);
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        
        .security-notice {
            background: #fef3c7;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        
        .security-notice-title {
            color: #d97706;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        
        .security-notice-text {
            color: #92400e;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .expiry-notice {
            text-align: center;
            color: #374151;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        
        .expiry-notice strong {
            color: #111827;
        }
        
        .email-footer {
            background: #111827;
            color: #9ca3af;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .footer-logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #f9fafb;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .footer-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #d1d5db;
        }
        
        .social-links {
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        
        .social-link {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: 0 5px;
            line-height: 40px;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .social-link:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }
        
        .footer-links {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        .footer-link {
            color: #d1d5db;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 10px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        
        .footer-link:hover {
            color: #f9fafb;
        }
        
        .alternative-link {
            color: #4b5563;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .alternative-link-url {
            color: #667eea;
            word-break: break-all;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: block;
            margin-top: 8px;
            background: #f3f4f6;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="email-header" style="background: #667eea; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 50px 40px; text-align: center;">
            <div class="logo-container">
                <div class="logo" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; background: white; border-radius: 20px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; color: #667eea; margin: 0 auto 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);">R</div>
                <h1 style="color: #ffffff !important; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 10px 0; text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);">Welcome to RLIFE! 🎉</h1>
                <p style="color: #ffffff !important; font-size: 16px; margin: 0; text-shadow: 1px 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);">You're one step away from organizing your student life</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Body -->
        <div class="email-body">
            <div class="greeting">
                Hey {{ user.firstName }}! 👋
            </div>
            
            <div class="message">
                We're <strong>super excited</strong> to have you join the RLIFE community! You've just taken the first step toward a more organized, productive, and stress-free student life.
            </div>
            
            <div class="message">
                To get started, please verify your email address by clicking the button below:
            </div>
            
            <!-- CTA Button -->
            <div class="cta-container" style="text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;">
                <a href="{{ verificationUrl }}" class="cta-button" style="display: inline-block; background: #667eea !important; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none !important; padding: 18px 50px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4); border: 2px solid #667eea;">
                    ✨ Verify My Account
                </a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="expiry-notice">
                ⏱️ This link will expire in <strong>24 hours</strong> for security reasons
            </div>
            
            <!-- Features -->
            <div class="features">
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">📚</div>
                    <div class="feature-text">
                        <div class="feature-title">Course Management</div>
                        <div class="feature-description">Organize all your courses, lectures, and study materials in one place</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">📅</div>
                    <div class="feature-text">
                        <div class="feature-title">Smart Planning</div>
                        <div class="feature-description">Never miss a deadline with intelligent reminders and scheduling</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🧠</div>
                    <div class="feature-text">
                        <div class="feature-title">Spaced Repetition</div>
                        <div class="feature-description">Master any subject with AI-powered flashcards and study techniques</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">💚</div>
                    <div class="feature-text">
                        <div class="feature-title">Wellbeing Tracking</div>
                        <div class="feature-description">Monitor your stress levels and maintain a healthy study-life balance</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="divider"></div>
            
            <!-- Security Notice -->
            <div class="security-notice">
                <div class="security-notice-title">
                    🔒 Security Notice
                </div>
                <div class="security-notice-text">
                    If you didn't create an account with RLIFE, please ignore this email. Your email address will not be added to our system without verification.
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="alternative-link" style="margin-top: 30px;">
                <strong>If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</strong>
                <a href="{{ verificationUrl }}" class="alternative-link-url">{{ verificationUrl }}</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="email-footer">
            <div class="footer-logo">RLIFE</div>
            <div class="footer-text">
                Empowering students to achieve academic excellence
            </div>
            
            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="#" class="social-link">f</a>
                <a href="#" class="social-link">t</a>
                <a href="#" class="social-link">in</a>
                <a href="#" class="social-link">ig</a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="#" class="footer-link">Help Center</a>
                <a href="#" class="footer-link">Privacy Policy</a>
                <a href="#" class="footer-link">Terms of Service</a>
            </div>
            
            <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af;">
                © {{ 'now'|date('Y') }} RLIFE. All rights reserved.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
